+\end{itemize}
+
+\subsection{Research Engineering Topics}
+\begin{itemize}
+  \item reproducibility through random seeds
+  \item experiment configuration
+  \item model comparison
+  \item visualization
+  \item backtesting ideas
+\end{itemize}
+
+\section{Why This Repo Feels Difficult}
+This project can feel confusing for a beginner for a few reasons:
+\begin{itemize}
+  \item it is missing a README or clear setup guide,
+  \item it mixes notebook code with framework-style script code,
+  \item it uses both TensorFlow and PyTorch,
+  \item it jumps from data cleaning to advanced models quickly,
+  \item it is written more like a research experiment than a teaching project.
+\end{itemize}
+
